{"task_id": "Mbpp/222", "solution": "def check_type(input_tuple: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True iff all elements in input_tuple have the exact same type.\n    Uses type() for exact comparison; returns True for an empty tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(input_tuple) == 0:\n        return True\n    first_type = type(input_tuple[0])\n    for element in input_tuple[1:]:\n        if type(element) is not first_type:\n            return False\n    return True"}
