{"task_id": "Mbpp/583", "solution": "def catalan_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the nth Catalan number using exact integer arithmetic.\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    # Calculate the central binomial coefficient C(2n, n)\n    # C(2n, n) = product_{i=1 to n} (2n - i + 1) / i\n    binomial_coefficient = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        binomial_coefficient = binomial_coefficient * (2 * n - i + 1) // i\n\n    # The nth Catalan number C_n = C(2n, n) / (n + 1)\n    return binomial_coefficient // (n + 1)"}
