{"task_id": "Mbpp/790", "solution": "def even_position(list_input: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if every even index in a list contains an even number.\n    Raises TypeError if input is not a list or if an element at an even index is not an integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(list_input, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"list_input must be a list\")\n\n    for i in range(0, len(list_input), 2):\n        element = list_input[i]\n        if not isinstance(element, int):\n            raise TypeError(f\"element at index {i} is not an int\")\n        if element % 2 != 0:\n            return False\n    return True"}
